    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "We rely on premium raw materials to enhance the quality ofour products. Our focus is on high-quality materials from around the world, like chemicals and packaging materials.These form the foundation of our top-notch products. Discover our dedication to quality through the essential materials that fuel our success."
    },
